    {
      "id": "CO-ING-6-2026-W07-describing-people-001-MASTERY-v9",
      "statement": "\"She is tall and thin. She has long straight hair. She wears glasses. Who could she be?\"",
      "context": "In Cúcuta, students read a description and identify the person.",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "A baby",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Los bebés no son altos ni usan gafas típicamente."
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "A primary school student",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Posible, pero \"tall\" sugiere alguien mayor."
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "A high school teacher",
          "is_correct": true,
          "feedback": "Correcto. Una profesora alta y delgada con gafas es una descripción plausible."
        },
        {
          "letter": "D",
          "text": "A toddler",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Un niño pequeño no es alto."
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Leer descripciones requiere conectar adjetivos con personas plausibles. \"Tall\", \"glasses\", \"long straight hair\" describe a una adulta o adolescente.\r\n\r\n---",
      "difficulty": "6",
